:"GNU General Public License v2.0","spdx_id":"GPL-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/gpl-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTg="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["closember","code-quality","hacktoberfest","linter","pep8","static-analysis","static-code-analysis"],"visibility":"public","forks":1204,"open_issues":1060,"watchers":5620,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Similar to #409.\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass Mine:\r\n    def __init__(self, value: int):\r\n        self.value = value\r\n\r\n    def get_value(self) -> int:\r\n        print(\"Getting\")\r\n        return self._value\r\n\r\n    def set_value(self, value: int) -> None:\r\n        self._value = value\r\n\r\n    value = property(get_value, set_value)\r\n```\r\n```\r\n$  python3.8 -m pylint --version                                      \r\npylint 2.4.4\r\nastroid 2.3.3\r\nPython 3.8.0 (default, Oct 28 2019, 16:14:01) \r\n[GCC 8.3.0]\r\n```\r\n```\r\n$  python3.8 -m pylint --disable=C0114,C0115,C0116 /tmp/pylint_test.py\r\n************* Module pylint_test\r\n/tmp/pylint_test.py:11:8: W0201: Attribute '_value' defined outside __init__ (attribute-defined-outside-init)\r\n\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nYour code has been rated at 9.00/10 (previous run: 9.00/10, +0.00)\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3325/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3325/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]